{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Glucose-Induced Insulin Secretion (Hybrid Dynamics)",
    "description": "Demonstrates heterogeneous dynamics: continuous glucose metabolism coupled to stochastic gene regulation. Showcases convergent coupling (multiple glucose sources), regulatory coupling (ATP-dependent transcription), and parallel stochastic+continuous execution.",
    "author": "SHYPN",
    "created": "2025-12-11",
    "version": "1.0",
    "biological_context": "Pancreatic β-cells sense glucose via metabolism (continuous ATP production) which triggers insulin gene expression (stochastic low-copy mRNA) and secretion. Multiple glucose sources converge (dietary, glycogenolysis)."
  },
  "places": [
